# =============================================================================
#  W1CK3D'S KALI ASSIST — PRIVATE / CLOSED-SOURCE REPOSITORY
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  This repo holds the SOURCE CODE and the internal design BLUEPRINTS
#  (docs/specs/). It must NEVER be made public.
#
#  Distribution model: only the COMPILED tool file (the built wizard) is ever
#  released — as a GitHub Release asset on a SEPARATE public repo. The source
#  in this repo and the docs/specs blueprints are NOT shipped, so the future
#  Enterprise edition stays protected.
#
#  NOTE: a .gitignore does NOT hide tracked source. Protection comes from
#  keeping THIS repo private and never pushing it to a public remote.
#  (As of init: no remote is configured. Keep it that way unless it's private.)
# =============================================================================

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# PyInstaller build *intermediates* only.
# The built binary itself is published via GitHub Releases, not committed here.
build/
dist/
*.spec

# Local runtime state that must never be committed (may contain user data):
*.audit.jsonl
audit-logs/
local_state/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
